{"type":"Film","id":"SI2021_003","slug":"si2021-003-nekoc-so-bili-ljudje","title":{"native":"Nekoč so bili ljudje","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2021-10-21","year":2021},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Goran Vojnović","slug":"goran-vojnovic","name":"Goran Vojnović","birthYear":1980,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Slovenia","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt13576582/mediaviewer/rm1563465986/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nNfxRODBcuI&ab_channel=ArsmediaSI"},"synopsis":{"native":"Leo je italijan, ki živi v Sloveniji. Vučko je bosanec, ki je kot otrok pribežal v Slovenijo. Leo v Sloveniji vztraja zaradi bivšega dekleta Anite in sina Valterja, v upanju, da bodo spet postali družina. Vučko noče k bratu na Švedsko, ker ne želi biti spet begunec. Ko jima banka odkloni obljubljeno posojilo za obnovo restavracije, sta Leo in Vučko prisiljena sprejeti ponudbo prevaranta Giannija. Ukrasti morata njegov tovornjak, da lahko Gianni pobere denar od zavarovanja. A namesto Giannijevega tovornjaka Leo in Vučko ukradeta tovornjak poln beguncev. Begunec Vučko in migrant Leo tako nehote postaneta krojilca usode podobno nesrečnih ljudi. Da bi rešila svoje finančne težave, se jih odločita prodati. In če se sprva še zdi, da jima za begunce ni vseeno, je iz dneva v dan v Leu in Vučku vse manj človeškega.","english":"The artist Mary Bauermeister is considered the mother of the Fluxus movement. In the 1960s, well-known artists frequented her studio in Cologne's Lintgasse."},"production":[{"country":"Slovenia","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"SI2021_002_02","film":"SI2021_003","person":{"id":"Silva Čušin","slug":"silva-cusin","name":"Silva Čušin","birthYear":1957,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Slovenia","awards":[]},"age":"4: Fourth Age (>75)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","